:81288:17981:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c92511","characterName":"シャオン・ベルナルド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"81291","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"313964"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23066"],"vndbCharacterId":"c92511"},"originalCharacterName":"シャオン・ベルナルド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Protagonist of the story. He is picked up and raised by Pigaro in the sacred mountain."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Pigaro is a father and mentor. Evita is his stepsister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shaon is honest and really values his family"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He can also use martial arts based on his master's teaching."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His Tenken is healing type, but at the start of the story, he gained new power by forming a contract with Minjara."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c92511"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の主人公。ピガロに拾われ霊域と呼ばれる辺境の山奥で育てられた。ピガロが父であり師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エビータは義理の妹。素直な性格で家族を大切にしており師匠の教育方針で拳法も使える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天眷は回復系だが物語冒頭で人造神ミンジャラと契約する事で新しい力を得た。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23066","sourceWorkId":"29938","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の主人公。ピガロに拾われ霊域と呼ばれる"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"辺境の山奥で育てられた。ピガロが父であり師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エビータは義理の妹。素直な性格で家族を大切にしており"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"師匠の教育方針で拳法も使える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天眷は回復系だが物語冒頭で人造神ミンジャラと"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"契約する事で新しい力を得た。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"81291"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/604b7e98f4bdc0a3e67a0a2f0c21422d53e17aebfdf685057ecf3ca3cf4e551a.